00:01:34.829 --> 00:01:37.965 size:53% position:73% line:53%
KARINA GOULD,

00:01:35.963 --> 00:01:39.133 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ministre fédérale de la Famide e

00:01:37.131 --> 00:01:40.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Les gens sont en train de

00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:41.435 size:53% position:73% line:53%
